+# Slice: orders.expedite_order
+
+**Kind:** command
+**Status:** live
+**Owner:** orders-team
+**Purpose:** Expedite a placed order so the warehouse picks it first.
+
+## Invariants
+- Only a PLACED order can be expedited (enforced by `ExpediteOrderDecider`).
+- Expediting an already-expedited order is a no-op (idempotent).
+
+## Boundaries
+**Reacts to / reads:** `ExpediteOrder` command (via `/api/orders/{orderId}/expedite`); Order stream
+**Publishes:** `OrderExpedited` (owned by this slice)
+
+## Data
+**Owns (writes):** Order stream (`OrderExpedited`)
+**Reads:** Order stream
