+# Slice: orders.expedited_orders
+
+**Kind:** view
+**Status:** live
+**Owner:** orders-team
+**Purpose:** The board of expedited orders, for the warehouse supervisor.
+
+## Boundaries
+**Reacts to / reads:** `OrderExpedited` (the BC's public events in `orders/events/`)
+**Serves:** `GET /api/orders/expedited`, `GET /api/orders/expedited/{orderId}`
+
+## Data
+**Owns (writes):** `ExpeditedOrderRow` read model (PostgreSQL DocumentDB, `orders_expedited_orders`)
+**Reads:** Order event stream, through `ExpeditedOrdersProjection` (a `ViewEventProcessor`)
